-- Where every plot of a town sits, relative to the town's plaza (metres; +x east, +z south).
-- Every town has the same layout, so these 1,000 rows cover all towns: house number h is row
-- ((h - 1) % 1000) + 1 of its town. The database uses them to check that two houses are neighbours
-- (section 6 of schema.sql). Run this file after schema.sql; it's safe to run again.
--
-- Generated from lotForPlot() in src/components/land/layout.ts (Town 1's lots, whose plaza is at 0,0).
-- The layout must never change once people have joined, so neither should this file.
on conflict (n) do update set x = excluded.x, z = excluded.z;
